---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base
  title="Privacy Policy — CouponsAndDeals"
  description="CouponsAndDeals's privacy policy: no accounts, no personal data collection, affiliate link and analytics practices."
  canonical="/privacy"
>
  <div class="wrap" style="max-width:760px;padding:2rem 1.1rem">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="intro">Last updated: July 2026</p>

    <h2>What we collect</h2>
    <p>
      CouponsAndDeals has no user accounts, no sign-up, and no forms. We do not collect,
      store, or sell personal information. The site is a set of static pages
      served from a CDN.
    </p>

    <h2>Outbound clicks</h2>
    <p>
      When you click "Show Code" or "Get Deal", you pass through a redirect on our
      domain (<code>/go/…</code>) to the store's site. We count these clicks in
      aggregate (store name, referring page, browser user-agent) to see which
      offers are useful. No cookies are set and no personal identifiers are stored
      by us.
    </p>

    <h2>Affiliate links</h2>
    <p>
      Outbound links carry our affiliate tracking IDs. The destination store and
      its affiliate network (Impact, Commission Junction, Awin, Rakuten, or
      similar) may set cookies on their own domains to attribute purchases; their
      privacy policies govern that data. See our
      <a href="/about">affiliate disclosure</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>Hosting</h2>
    <p>
      The site is served by Cloudflare, which processes standard server logs
      (IP address, request URL) to deliver and secure the site, per
      <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/" rel="noopener">Cloudflare's privacy policy</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      Privacy questions: <a href="mailto:contact@example.com">contact@example.com</a>.
      <!-- TODO: replace with your real contact address -->
    </p>
  </div>
</Base>
